{"title":"Tools to Run Your Business","startsAt":"2026-11-10T18:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-10T20:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"For new business owners, staying organized can be just as challenging to find customers. This session will explore the tools that can take routine work off your plate. From bookkeeping and invoicing, to scheduling, payments, customer records, marketing, and social media creation. We will also look at where AI tools can genuinely help save time and add value versus making unnecessary work. We'll discover where to find free resources, and how to avoid subscribing to services that won't be of value in the long run. You'll leave with a concise list of tools appropriate for new business owners.\n\nThe program includes a short networking component, providing participants with an opportunity to connect with other entrepreneurs.\n\nPresented by Ryan Knight, TPL's 2026 [Entrepreneur in Residence](https://tpl.ca/programs-and-classes/featured/entrepreneur-in-residence/) (EIR) at Toronto Reference Library.\n\n**Registration via TPL website:** [https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99b901d94765189bb97c31](https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99b901d94765189bb97c31)\n**Drop-ins welcome until room capacity is reached.**\n\nAccessibility\nLive or automated closed captioning, sign language interpretation, intervenor services, or attendant services are available upon request. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to: [tpl.ca/accessibility-events](https://tpl.ca/accessibility/accessibility-supports/programs-and-events/?_gl=1*v83hy7*_ga*NDk5MDg2NTE1LjE3NjYwMDgxODQ.*_ga_G99DMMNG39*czE3NjkxMDY3NDMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzY5MTA2ODM0JGozOCRsMCRoMA..).","venue":{"name":"Toronto Public Library - Toronto Reference Library","address":"789 Yonge St, Toronto, ON M4W 2G8, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.671806,"lng":-79.38682,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Public Library Small Business Networking Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/b/6/3/highres_536307491.jpeg"}